  },
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": -1840,
   "width": 1260,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "# LLaDA2.2-mini — model  \nA **masked-diffusion** LM: it does not emit one token per forward pass. Text is produced in blocks of 32 positions that start as `<|mask|>` and are filled in over several **denoising steps**, each one a full forward pass. Grey bars = tensors (length ∝ channels, 0.08 px/channel), boxes = operations. T = prompt + finished blocks + the active block. *Layer* tab = one layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": -1840,
   "width": 1260,
   "height": 200,
   "text": "**Numbers**: shapes from the safetensors headers (14813 tensors, BF16), sizes from config.json, decoding rules and their defaults from `generate()` / `_joint_decode_block()` in the repo's modeling_llada2_moe.py.    \nActive per token ≈ **1.11B** without the embedding table, 1.43B with it — the model card's \"1.4B activated\" matches the second. Stored total **16.26B** (card: 16B)."
  },
  {
   "id": "strip",
   "type": "group",
   "x": -820,
   "y": -1360,
   "width": 1640,
   "height": 150,
   "label": "x — the working sequence, one token id per position",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
