   "text": "Each MoE layer = 819.5M stored, of which 805.3M in 256 routed experts (3.1M each); a token runs 8 of them plus the shared one.    \nAttention: GQA 16 query / 4 KV heads × 128, **not causal** (`is_causal = False`)."
  },
