   "x": -1020,
   "y": -486,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "Built in `generate()`: `tril(ones(blocks, blocks))` expanded to 32×32 tiles. An autoregressive LM would mask per *token* (strict lower triangle); here a masked position can use tokens to its **right** inside its block."
