   "type": "text",
   "x": -210,
   "y": 518,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 96,
   "text": "**M2T** · mask → token    \nfill `<|mask|>` slots with p > 0.5; at least the schedule's share (32 masks over 32 steps)",
   "color": "#e879f9"
  },
  {
   "id": "t2t19",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -210,
   "y": 654,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 76,
   "text": "**T2T** · token → token    \nrewrite an already-filled slot when x̂ differs and p > 0.0",
   "color": "#e879f9"
  },
  {
   "id": "edit20",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -210,
   "y": 770,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 96,
   "text": "**Levenshtein edits**    \n`DELETE` drops its slot · `INSERT` (split) puts a fresh `<|mask|>` before the token · block re-padded / cut to 32",
   "color": "#e879f9"
  },
